@startuml
title 08 - Observer de notificaciones Lock/Wall
left to right direction
package "ar.edu.uade.sokoban.movement" {
 class RuntimeState <<immutable record>>
 class RuntimeMovementEngine
}
package "ar.edu.uade.sokoban.desktop" {
 interface GameView
 class GameController
 class LockChangeSubject <<Subject>>
 interface "LockChangeSubject.Observer" as Observer
 class "LockChangeSubject.Event" as Event <<record>>
 class "LockChangeSubject.Delta" as Delta <<record>>
 enum "LockChangeSubject.Origin" as Origin
 class GatePresentationObserver
 class LockSoundObserver
}
GameController *-- LockChangeSubject : owns window scoped subscriptions
GameController ..> GatePresentationObserver : subscribes
GameController ..> LockSoundObserver : subscribes
GameController ..> RuntimeState : before/after
LockChangeSubject --> "0..*" Observer : subscribers
LockChangeSubject ..> Event : publishes confirmed delta
Event --> "0..*" Delta
Event --> Origin
Observer <|.. GatePresentationObserver
Observer <|.. LockSoundObserver
GatePresentationObserver --> GameView : requests repaint
LockSoundObserver --> GameView : requests sound
LockChangeSubject ..> RuntimeState : calculates changes only
RuntimeMovementEngine ..> RuntimeState : domain owns wall rules
@enduml
